@startuml 事件触发场景示例图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 50

title 事件触发场景示例

== 场景1: 工作流启动事件触发 ==

participant "CommandEngine" as Engine
participant "WorkflowEventBus" as EventBus
participant "DelayQueue" as Queue
participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker
participant "WorkflowStartLifecycleEventHandler" as StartHandler
participant "WorkflowRunningStateAction" as RunningAction

Engine -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent)
activate EventBus
EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(event)
activate Queue
Queue --> EventBus: 事件已入队
deactivate Queue
EventBus --> Engine: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus

note over Engine: **事件发布完成，继续其他操作**

... 100ms后 ...

FireWorker -> Queue: poll()
activate Queue
Queue --> FireWorker: WorkflowStartLifecycleEvent
deactivate Queue

FireWorker -> FireWorker: eventHandlerMap.get(START)
FireWorker -> StartHandler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
activate StartHandler

StartHandler -> RunningAction: startEventAction(...)
activate RunningAction
RunningAction -> RunningAction: triggerTasks()
RunningAction -> EventBus: publish(TaskStartLifecycleEvent)
activate EventBus
EventBus -> Queue: delayEventQueue.add(newEvent)
activate Queue
Queue --> EventBus: 新事件已入队
deactivate Queue
EventBus --> RunningAction: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus

RunningAction --> StartHandler: 处理完成
deactivate RunningAction
StartHandler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
deactivate StartHandler

== 场景2: Worker回调事件触发 ==

participant "Worker" as Worker
participant "RPC" as RPC
participant "TaskExecutorEventListenerImpl" as Listener
participant "WorkflowEventBus" as EventBus2
participant "DelayQueue" as Queue2
participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker2
participant "TaskSuccessLifecycleEventHandler" as SuccessHandler
participant "TaskRunningStateAction" as TaskRunningAction

Worker -> Worker: 任务执行成功
Worker -> RPC: 调用 Master\nonTaskExecutorSuccess(event)
activate RPC

RPC -> Listener: onTaskExecutorSuccess(event)
activate Listener

Listener -> Listener: getTaskExecutionRunnable(event)
Listener -> Listener: 构建 TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent

Listener -> EventBus2: publish(TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent)
activate EventBus2
EventBus2 -> Queue2: delayEventQueue.add(event)
activate Queue2
Queue2 --> EventBus2: 事件已入队
deactivate Queue2
EventBus2 --> Listener: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus2

Listener --> RPC: 回调完成
deactivate Listener
RPC --> Worker: RPC 调用返回
deactivate RPC

note over Worker: **Worker 继续其他操作，不等待事件处理**

... 100ms后 ...

FireWorker2 -> Queue2: poll()
activate Queue2
Queue2 --> FireWorker2: TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent
deactivate Queue2

FireWorker2 -> FireWorker2: eventHandlerMap.get(SUCCEEDED)
FireWorker2 -> SuccessHandler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
activate SuccessHandler

SuccessHandler -> TaskRunningAction: succeedEventAction(...)
activate TaskRunningAction

TaskRunningAction -> TaskRunningAction: 更新任务状态为 SUCCESS
TaskRunningAction -> TaskRunningAction: 发布拓扑转换事件
TaskRunningAction -> EventBus2: publish(WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent)
activate EventBus2
EventBus2 -> Queue2: delayEventQueue.add(newEvent)
activate Queue2
Queue2 --> EventBus2: 新事件已入队
deactivate Queue2
EventBus2 --> TaskRunningAction: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus2

TaskRunningAction --> SuccessHandler: 处理完成
deactivate TaskRunningAction
SuccessHandler --> FireWorker2: 处理完成
deactivate SuccessHandler

== 场景3: 事件链式触发 ==

participant "StateAction1" as Action1
participant "WorkflowEventBus" as EventBus3
participant "DelayQueue" as Queue3
participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker3
participant "EventHandler1" as Handler1
participant "StateAction2" as Action2
participant "EventHandler2" as Handler2
participant "StateAction3" as Action3

Action1 -> EventBus3: publish(Event1)
activate EventBus3
EventBus3 -> Queue3: add(Event1)
activate Queue3
Queue3 --> EventBus3: 已入队
deactivate Queue3
EventBus3 --> Action1: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus3

... 100ms后 ...

FireWorker3 -> Queue3: poll() → Event1
FireWorker3 -> Handler1: handle(Event1)
activate Handler1
Handler1 -> Action2: 执行业务逻辑
activate Action2

Action2 -> EventBus3: publish(Event2)
activate EventBus3
EventBus3 -> Queue3: add(Event2)
activate Queue3
Queue3 --> EventBus3: 已入队
deactivate Queue3
EventBus3 --> Action2: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus3

Action2 --> Handler1: 处理完成
deactivate Action2
Handler1 --> FireWorker3: 处理完成
deactivate Handler1

note over FireWorker3: **继续处理队列中的 Event2**

FireWorker3 -> Queue3: poll() → Event2
FireWorker3 -> Handler2: handle(Event2)
activate Handler2
Handler2 -> Action3: 执行业务逻辑
activate Action3

Action3 -> EventBus3: publish(Event3)
activate EventBus3
EventBus3 -> Queue3: add(Event3)
activate Queue3
Queue3 --> EventBus3: 已入队
deactivate Queue3
EventBus3 --> Action3: 立即返回
deactivate EventBus3

Action3 --> Handler2: 处理完成
deactivate Action3
Handler2 --> FireWorker3: 处理完成
deactivate Handler2

note over FireWorker3: **事件链式触发，形成完整的执行流程**

== 场景4: 异常处理和重试 ==

participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker4
participant "EventHandler" as Handler4
participant "StateAction" as Action4
participant "Database" as DB4
participant "WorkflowEventBus" as EventBus4
participant "DelayQueue" as Queue4

FireWorker4 -> Handler4: handle(workflow, event)
activate Handler4
Handler4 -> Action4: 执行业务逻辑
activate Action4

Action4 -> DB4: updateById(...)
activate DB4
DB4 --> Action4: **异常：数据库连接失败**
deactivate DB4

Action4 --> Handler4: 抛出异常
deactivate Action4
Handler4 --> FireWorker4: 异常传播
deactivate Handler4

FireWorker4 -> FireWorker4: catch Exception
FireWorker4 -> FireWorker4: isDatabaseConnectedFailedException(ex)?

alt 数据库连接失败
    FireWorker4 -> EventBus4: publish(event)
    activate EventBus4
    note right of EventBus4: **重新发布事件，等待重试**
    EventBus4 -> Queue4: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    activate Queue4
    Queue4 --> EventBus4: 事件已重新入队
    deactivate Queue4
    EventBus4 --> FireWorker4: 重新发布成功
    deactivate EventBus4
    
    FireWorker4 -> FireWorker4: ThreadUtils.sleep(5_000)
    note right of FireWorker4: **等待5秒后重试**
    
    ... 5秒后，继续轮询 ...
    
    FireWorker4 -> Queue4: poll() → event (重试)
    note over FireWorker4: **事件被重新处理**
    
else 其他异常
    FireWorker4 -> FireWorker4: 记录失败计数
    FireWorker4 -> FireWorker4: throw WorkflowEventFireException
end

== 总结 ==

note over Action1, Queue4
  **事件触发机制的关键特点：**
  
  1. **异步非阻塞**：publish() 立即返回
  2. **定时轮询**：每100ms轮询一次
  3. **类型映射**：根据事件类型快速找到 Handler
  4. **链式触发**：事件可以触发新事件
  5. **异常重试**：数据库连接失败时自动重试
  6. **多线程处理**：多个 Worker 并行处理
  
  **事件来源：**
  - 内部：Master 内部组件
  - 外部：Worker RPC 回调
end note

@enduml
